window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>With Thera absent and Naylet gone, Obie turns his attention to a string of disappearances in the ultranatural community. As the Keepers uncover clues Holt is the next to go missing. It’s a race against the clock as Obie discovers who’s behind the disappearances. He must find Holt and the other missing ultras before their abductors' plans come full circle.</p>"; 
